WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
That's fine. Come with me. My home is not far away.

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,840
Brother, if you go, I will definitely go too.

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,720
My house is on the fifth floor which is a bit high

4
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,960
Don't worry when you move things later.

5
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,280
You can move it slowly

6
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:11,080
My husband is also up there.

7
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,840
I might have to trouble you to carry my husband down later.

8
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,800
His legs and feet were inconvenient and he couldn't walk. He came back fine.

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,120
Yes, back

10
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,440
These two young men are willing to help our family move things

11
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,800
I brought them back

12
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,440
Just sit here and don't worry about it.

13
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:27,010
Hello, old man, let's do it.

14
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,650
Just take a good rest here

15
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:29,970
How can you be so embarrassed?

16
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,570
The money I gave is not much

17
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:34,130
I just thought I could help and move together.

18
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,130
No need

19
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:37,810
Since we agreed, we will naturally help you move it. It doesn’t matter.

20
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:40,690
I’ve known for a long time that people always attract disapproval.

21
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:42,810
Don’t say that ordinary people despise themselves

22
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:45,650
Don’t your own children also ignore you?

23
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:48,450
But this guy paid a price that was significantly lower than the market price

24
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:50,290
Come over and help me move my things.

25
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:51,730
Even when I want to help

26
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:53,050
He refused to help

27
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:54,330
You guys hurry up and load the goods.

28
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:56,730
If the installation is slow, I will charge you here.

29
00:00:56,730 --> 00:00:58,330
And if you don’t want to charge additional fees?

30
00:00:58,330 --> 00:00:59,770
Can you please install these things?

31
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:01,650
I'll charge you two hundred dollars to help you load it into the car.

32
00:01:01,650 --> 00:01:03,170
Fellow townsman, help move it up.
